...
#
# A fatal error has been detected by the Java &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Runtime&lt;/span&gt; Environment:
#
#  SIGSEGV (0xb) at pc=0x00007faeb806d5e4, pid=26471, tid=140392269498112
#
# JRE version: Java(TM) SE &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Runtime&lt;/span&gt; Environment (8.0_77-b03) (build 1.8.0_77-b03)
# Java VM: Java HotSpot(TM) 64-Bit Server VM (25.77-b03 mixed mode linux-amd64 compressed oops)
# Problematic frame:
# C  [libignite-odbc.so+0x2c5e4]  ignite::odbc::system::TcpSocketClient::Connect(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;char&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt;*, unsigned &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;short&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;, ignite::odbc::diagnostic::Diagnosable&amp;amp;)+0x7b4
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The contents of Ignite driver log file as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
